records.key:
A regex with named groups sorts every image into a channel and a set (one field across all channels). chanID is the channel; plateID, wellID, fieldID and timeID say where a set goes; any other named group only tells sets apart. Images assigned to a channel by selection keep that channel.
Examples:
spaCR's Yokogawa default: {cellvoyager}
well, field and channel: {typical}
names made by Consolidate folders: {consolidated}

